          "name": "box_temp_true",
          "unit": "degC",
          "initial": -20.0,
          "min": -30.0,
          "max": 40.0,
          "description": "The actual box temperature. Never observable directly; supply/return air channels observe it through noise. The regulated metric: crossing -18 C is an excursion."
        },
        {
          "name": "excursion_minutes",
          "unit": "min",
          "initial": 0.0,
          "min": 0.0,
          "max": 100000.0,
          "description": "Director-only ground truth: cumulative minutes the box spent above -18 C (threshold_integrator over box_temp_true). The number the scorer checks the agent's cumulative against. Never observed by any channel; the per-sample dwell indicator on supply_air_temp traces is derived from it."
        }
      ],
